  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nSimplify the following expression:\n\n(4.2 of 2.5 ÷ 3.5) - (3.6 ÷ 2.4 + 2.5 of 3 ÷ 7.5) + (6 - 3 of 2 + 4 of 3 ÷ 6)\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nof means multiplication (×)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(4.2 × 2.5 ÷ 3.5) - (3.6 ÷ 2.4 + 2.5 × 3 ÷ 7.5) + (6 - 3 × 2 + 4 × 3 ÷ 6)\n\n⇒ (10.5 ÷ 3.5) - (1.5 + 7.5 ÷ 7.5) + (6 - 6 + 12 ÷ 6)\n\n⇒ 3 - (1.5 + 1) + (6 - 6 + 2)\n\n⇒ 3 - 2.5 + 2\n\n⇒ 0.5 + 2\n\n⇒ 2.5\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (4).**",
